## AppState の構造

```rust
struct AppState {
    config: Mutex<Config>,
    pairing_info: Mutex<Option<PairingInfo>>,
    sidecar_child: Mutex<Option<CommandChild>>,
}
```

## Sidecar の起動（tauri-plugin-shell）

```rust
use tauri_plugin_shell::ShellExt;

let sidecar = app.shell().sidecar("matter-sidecar")?;
let (mut rx, child) = sidecar.spawn()?;

tokio::spawn(async move {
    while let Some(event) = rx.recv().await {
        match event {
            CommandEvent::Stdout(line) => dispatch_sidecar_message(&app_handle, &line),
            CommandEvent::Terminated(_) => {
                app_handle.emit("sidecar-offline", ()).ok();
            }
            _ => {}
        }
    }
});
```

## Sidecar へのメッセージ送信

```rust
fn send_to_sidecar(child: &mut CommandChild, msg_type: &str, payload: serde_json::Value) {
    let msg = serde_json::json!({ "type": msg_type, "payload": payload });
    let line = msg.to_string() + "\n";
    child.write(line.as_bytes()).ok();
}
```

## Sidecar から受信するメッセージ処理

```rust
fn dispatch_sidecar_message(app: &AppHandle, line: &[u8]) {
    let msg: serde_json::Value = serde_json::from_slice(line).unwrap_or_default();
    match msg["type"].as_str() {
        Some("ready")         => { /* サーバー起動完了 */ }
        Some("qr_code")       => { /* pairing_info をメモリに保存 */ }
        Some("device_status") => { app.emit("device-status-changed", &msg["payload"]).ok(); }
        Some("action_result") => { /* エラーなら action-error イベントを emit */ }
        _ => {}
    }
}
```

## macOS 権限チェック

```rust
// Cargo.toml に追加: accessibility-sys = "0.1"
#[cfg(target_os = "macos")]
fn check_accessibility() -> bool {
    unsafe { accessibility_sys::AXIsProcessTrusted() }
}
```

## 必要な Tauri プラグイン（Cargo.toml）

```toml
[dependencies]
tauri = { version = "2", features = ["macos-private-api"] }
tauri-plugin-shell = "2"       # Sidecar 管理
tauri-plugin-autostart = "2"   # ログイン時自動起動
serde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }
serde_json = "1"
tokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }
accessibility-sys = "0.1"      # アクセシビリティ権限チェック
```

## tauri.conf.json の重要設定

- `productName`: "Matter Mac Agent"
- `identifier`: "com.matter-mac-agent"
- `bundle.externalBin`: `["binaries/matter-sidecar"]`（Sidecar バイナリ登録時に追加）
